be able to go back to your community, being both a home.

00:31:00.000 --> 00:31:06.640
and a parent. New Orleans is a place where I have roots and would have loved to raise my family.

00:31:06.800 --> 00:31:25.460
The reputation that you might have established for yourself in New Orleans, that didn't come

00:31:25.460 --> 00:31:29.760
with you. There's no one here that know about your work, you know, unless you were extremely

00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:34.520
prominent in what you did, but most people had humble beginnings and were working class

00:31:34.520 --> 00:31:40.090
people caring for their families as best they could. My family, for example, we've never

00:31:40.090 --> 00:31:47.380
needed public assistance. We found ourselves here in the line for public assistance. I've

