00:32:37.880 --> 00:32:40.600
And both my mother and my mother-in-law are here.

00:32:41.180 --> 00:32:48.420
So those things let me know that he's missing the attachments that he had with New Orleans.

00:32:51.320 --> 00:32:53.160
